<title>USA: Johnston joins PaineWebber muni research group.</title>
<headline>Johnston joins PaineWebber muni research group.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michael Johnston, formerly director of research at Sandler O'Neill and Partners LP, will join PaineWebber Inc as director of municipal research, company officials said Thursday.  </p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
